literal claude
## Output
END

blank claude

entry output.contract
prose claude
Return only the drafted message(s). If the diff is empty or intent is unclear,
say so instead of inventing a plausible message.
END
prose codex
Output: return only the drafted message(s). If the diff is empty or intent is
unclear, say so instead of inventing a plausible message.
END
